iction.","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"cc38a09b-95b3-51e0-a323-d4a574bc0903"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.90.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.90.010","content_hash":"1850e1b2a8dbe946a4b22adcbca625a3235d97bf0481696eff9742b5c1499596","heading":null,"ordinal":5,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:5","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.90.010","text":"“Crime of violence” means:","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"882e95d7-85ca-53e1-8f85-7396dfd2bf1e"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.90.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.90.010","content_hash":"a8d712a61462993cef4d39e51bf5be32db7e4cdcfbd761dddab9afe6ef113555","heading":null,"ordinal":6,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:6","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.90.010","text":"(1) An offense that has as an element the use, attempted use, or threatened use of physical force against the person or property of another; or","type":"paragraph","workbench_component_id":"d5d48125-1c5b-5d90-b0c4-408e5fef5955"},{"attributes":{"block_kind":"paragraph"},"citation":"5.90.010","citation_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.90.010","content_hash":"c8eaaf545b2359aeffaf95735c49d5bf906d343b55c81ffbe1cbb1ca58660f02","heading":null,"ordinal":7,"parent_source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:section","schema":"exais.workbench_component.v1","source_component_key":"ks:city:topeka:municipal-code:tmc:5.90.010:block:7","source_url":"https://topeka.municipal.codes/TMC/5.90.010","text":"(2) Any other offense that is a felony or misdemeanor and that, by it